    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac97ca2aaf6bf803eaf90141",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『始终在为她担忧』\n这话听起来固然悦耳。但是……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6631a30d7f9f4b576fcca525085ead2be419d1a57ef89dd0c83c4c87506bbd84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        88,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/88/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f693dd825cdfbf9dfa296a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我是否过于倾向于稳妥的对策、\n而忽略了鼓励她去挑战呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a660737caf7bc61b949bd08cfff11cdca2dd57496c9f9dab81c9edd8007f52b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
